msgctxt "Tag Date-A-Dex"
msgid "Mateo and Davi have been reunited at last! He was trying to lead you to another lost inanimal, Stitch. Mateo needs to look Stitch over. Come back and see him soon!"
msgstr "Mateo et Davi sont enfin réunis ! Davi essayait de te mener jusqu'à un autre inanimal perdu, Stitch. Mateo doit examiner Stitch. Reviens le voir bientôt !"

