msgctxt "Tag Date-A-Dex"
msgid "You told Daemon about the bug_patch! Daemon did some sort of sorcery on you but it is unknown what it was. Hopefully it is not too bad!"
msgstr "Tu as parlé du bug_patch à Daemon ! Daemon t'a jeté une sorte de sortilège, mais on ne sait pas lequel. Espérons que ce n'est pas trop grave !"

